  "description": "DwarfMapper — a compile-time object mapper for .NET where an unmapped member is a build error, maps are round-trip-verifiable (opt in with [RoundTrip]), and blittable data falls back to SIMD/blittable bulk copy. The shipped runtime library uses zero reflection and is NativeAOT- and trim-safe. This single package bundles the attributes, the Roslyn source generator, and the IDE code fixes — just reference it.",
